"El Paso Warrants Lifted | What to Know Before You Pay": "",
"El Paso warrants lifted — speeding ticket": "",
"El Paso Municipal Court is renowned for its ability to issue active arrest warrants almost immediately after an appearance date or payment has been missed. As soon as the grace period passes, you can bet an El Paso arrest warrant is soon to follow. Once a warrant has been lifted there are a few ground rules you need to know in order to avoid making a bad situation worse. It is always good to consult with a traffic ticket lawyer in El Paso to know what your options are.": "",
"Don't just pay the ticket to lift the warrant": "",
"\"Just paying\" the El Paso traffic ticket will most definitely lift the warrant. What you may not realize is that by paying the citation, you now have a conviction on your driving record. Get the wrong conviction and you can receive a license suspension notice from the Department of Public Safety, and your insurance rates can rise for years. That is a hefty price for \"just paying\" a traffic ticket that went into warrant. A": "",
"warrant lawyer": "",
"can instead post an appearance bond, recall the warrant, and fight the underlying ticket.": "",
"Sitting out your warrant for El Paso traffic tickets": "",
"While you may get jail credit for sitting out a warrant, when you get out the case is still reported to DPS as a conviction, with the same license and insurance consequences — not to mention the time in jail. Don't go down that path. Hire me to assist you and give you great legal representation. Call": "",
